UPDATE "texts" SET "value_en" = 'ALQUDRA — Aldaema for Engineering Consultations is a leading engineering consultancy firm and an integrated ecosystem built on precision, innovation, and an unwavering commitment to the highest standards of quality and engineering governance.
The company was founded to be the trusted partner in the world of construction and development, specialising in engineering supervision, technical review, quality control management, and delivering integrated engineering solutions that balance operational efficiency with visual aesthetics.
Every study receives dedicated attention, and every document undergoes rigorous review, because our philosophy is grounded in one principle: engineering is not merely designs and blueprints. It is a human and national responsibility that we carry with professionalism and devotion toward our clients, society, and the environment.' WHERE "key" = 'about.story' AND "value_en" = 'ALQUDRA — Aldaema for Engineering Consultations is a leading engineering consultancy firm and an integrated ecosystem built on precision, innovation, and an unwavering commitment to the highest standards of quality and engineering governance.
The company was founded to be the trusted partner in the world of construction and development, specialising in engineering supervision, technical review, quality control management, and delivering integrated engineering solutions that balance operational efficiency with visual aesthetics.
Throughout our journey, we have participated in the supervision of more than 1,000 projects for over 200 clients across cities throughout Libya, with a steadfast focus on the infrastructure and urban planning sectors.
Every study receives dedicated attention, and every document undergoes rigorous review, because our philosophy is grounded in one principle: engineering is not merely designs and blueprints. It is a human and national responsibility that we carry with professionalism and devotion toward our clients, society, and the environment.';
